# Wyrd test project: testbenches of a 4-bit counter
file verilog counter.v
top counter
testbench good file tb_good.v top tb_good dut dut expect good.expect
testbench bad file tb_good.v top tb_good expect bad.expect
testbench both file tb_good.v top tb_good on both expect good.expect
testbench hang file tb_hang.v max-time 100
testbench err file tb_err.v
